Daren looks down at his sword pommel, drawing an inch of enchanted steel to check the edge before clicking it home. "Yes... I believe I do."

#if(v_ch11_saved_rose == 0) {
"Good," Arraka says. "That is enough lecturing for one night. Go to sleep."

